.\" ###### Setup ############################################################
.Dd November 26, 2026
.Dt pem2der 1
.Os pem2der
.\" ###### Name #############################################################
.Sh NAME
.Nm pem2der
.Nd converts an X.509 certificate, CRL, or CSR from PEM to DER format
.\" ###### Synopsis #########################################################
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm pem2der
.Ar pem\_file der\_file
.Nm pem2der
.Op Fl h | Fl \-help
.Nm pem2der
.Op Fl v | Fl \-version
.\" ###### Description ######################################################
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm pem2der
converts a given X.509 certificate, Certificate Revocation List (CRL), or Certificate Signing Request (CSR) file from PEM to DER format.
.\" ###### Arguments ########################################################
.Sh ARGUMENTS
The following arguments and options are available:
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Ar pem\_file
The certificate, CRL, or CSR file in PEM format to be converted.
"\-" is a shortcut for
.Pa /dev/stdin ,
i.e. reading the PEM data from standard input.
.It Ar der\_file
The certificate, CRL, or CSR file in DER format to be written.
"\-" is a shortcut for
.Pa /dev/stdout ,
i.e. writing the DER data to standard output.
.It Fl h | Fl \-help
Prints the program's command\-line parameters and exits.
.It Fl v | Fl \-version
Prints the program version and exits.
.El
.\" ###### Exit status ######################################################
.Sh EXIT STATUS
The
.Nm
tool exits with 0 on success, and >0 in case of an error.
.\" ###### Examples #########################################################
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bl -bullet
.It
pem2der my\-server\-certificate.crt my\-server\-certificate.der
.It
pem2der my\-crl.crl my\-crl.der
.It
pem2der my\-server\-certificate.crt \- > my\-server\-certificate.der
.It
pem2der \-\-help
.It
pem2der \-h
.It
pem2der \-\-version
.It
pem2der \-v
.El
